# CODEOWNERS — required reviewers for this repository.
#
# The org ruleset on `main` requires an approving review from a code owner.
# Listed accounts must have write access or GitHub silently ignores them.
#
# Both the maintainer and the designated reviewer are listed. An approval
# from either one satisfies the requirement, and GitHub never lets an author
# approve their own pull request — so a change opened by the maintainer still
# needs the reviewer, a change opened by the reviewer still needs the
# maintainer, and a change opened by anyone else can be unblocked by either.
# This is a single-author repository under Change Management Plan Appendix A.

